<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuehne &amp; Nagel acquires Ferroviasped.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel acquires Ferroviasped.</headline>
<dateline>SCHINDELLEGI, Switzerland 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG said it had acquired a 51 percent stake in the Ferroviasped transport group as part of a strategic alliance. It gave no financial terms.</p>
<p>The companies together operate more than 50 rail transport centres in Europe with annual volume of more than 10 million tonnes, it said in a statement. They will now coordinate their marketing and logistics activity.</p>
<p>Stakes in Ferroviasped held by the Swiss, Spanish, Danish and French railways are not affected by the deal, it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
